sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant API as Authenticated API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  B->>B: Update local working state
  B->>API: Save project/draft snapshot
  API->>API: Verify authenticated ownership
  API->>DB: Transactional write/reconciliation
  DB-->>API: Confirm save
  API-->>B: Project and draft identity
  B->>API: Resume using project ID
  API->>DB: Load owned active draft
  DB-->>API: Saved state and media
  API-->>B: Restore correct workflow/stage
